<title>DUBAI: GOLF-DUBAI CREEK OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-DUBAI CREEK OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading third scores in the Dubai</p>
<p>Creek Open golf tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>206 Choi Kyung-ju (South Korea) 70 69 67</p>
<p>208 Paul Friedlander (Swaziland) 69 70 69</p>
<p>211 Kyi Hla Han (Myanmar) 68 72 71</p>
<p>212 Mo Joong-Kyung (South Korea) 71 73 68</p>
<p>213 Lee Petters (UAE) 70 73 70</p>
